---

{% info title="Education program sunset" %}
The Appwrite Education program ends on **November 1st, 2026**. New enrollments will close before that date, and existing Education organizations will move off the program. Read the [announcement](/blog/post/sunsetting-appwrite-education-program) for details and next steps.
{% /info %}

The Appwrite Education program gave verified [GitHub Student Developer Pack](https://education.github.com/pack) members access to Appwrite Cloud with Pro-level resources for coursework and learning projects.

# Program status {% #program-status %}

**Effective November 1st, 2026**, Appwrite is sunsetting the Education program. After that date:

- New sign-ups through the Education program will no longer be accepted.
- Existing Education plan organizations will be transitioned off the program.
- Pro-level resources tied to the Education plan will no longer be available through GitHub Student Developer Pack verification.

We are reinvesting the time and cost of running the program into improvements to the [Free plan](/docs/advanced/billing/free) for all developers.

# Transition options {% #transition-options %}

If you are on the Education plan today, Appwrite will contact your organization before November 1st with transition guidance. You can prepare by reviewing these paths:

- **[Free plan](/docs/advanced/billing/free)**: Best for coursework and learning projects that fit within free tier limits.
- **[Pro plan](/docs/advanced/billing/pro)**: Best when you need dedicated project resources, higher limits, or production workloads.
- **[Self-hosting](/docs/advanced/self-hosting)**: Run the open-source Appwrite stack on infrastructure you control with no Appwrite-imposed usage caps beyond your hardware.

# What the Education plan included {% #what-the-education-plan-included %}

Before the sunset, verified students could create **two projects** with usage limits aligned to the Pro plan, minus email support. The plan was available for non-commercial educational use only.

Students can still build on Appwrite Cloud using the Free plan, Pro, or self-hosted Appwrite without the Education program.

